ApparitionAnisette
==================

This crate is a port of the anisette implementation from Apparition:

    Apparition — https://github.com/illixion/Apparition
    MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Illixion (see LICENSE in this directory)

Files taken from Apparition's `core/src/anisette/`, with only the
adaptations listed below:

    src/elf.rs   <- core/src/anisette/elf.rs   (ELF loader)
    src/shim.rs  <- core/src/anisette/shim.rs  (Bionic "libc" shims)
    src/adi.rs   <- core/src/anisette/adi.rs   (ADI driver)

Adaptations made for ODATest / iOS 15 (target aarch64-apple-ios,
embedded as a static library):

  * The upstream `rootcause` dependency was removed. Errors are plain
    `String`s via the crate-local `Result<T>` alias, with minimal
    `bail!` / `report!` macros keeping the original call sites intact.
  * Module paths were rewired to this crate (`crate::elf`,
    `crate::shim`); visibility widened from `pub(super)` to
    `pub(crate)` where needed.
  * `src/lib.rs` (the C FFI surface) is new and specific to ODATest.
  * NOT ported: upstream `server.rs` (the v3 HTTP server), `native.rs`
    (macOS-native anisette) and `apk.rs` (APK download/extraction).
    The Swift side of ODATest supplies the two library files, the
    provisioning folder and the network round-trip (spim/cpim).

Deliberately unchanged behaviour (variables under test — do not "fix"):

  * The obfuscated libstoreservicescore export names in adi.rs
    (kq56gsgHG6, Sph98paBcz, nf92ngaK92, fy34trz2st, uv5t6nhkui,
    rsegvyrt87, aslgmuibau, jk24uiwqrg, qi864985u0) and DS_ID = -2.
  * `shim_property_get` in shim.rs reports every Android system
    property as unset (writes an empty string, returns 0).
  * The ELF loader does not run DT_INIT / DT_INIT_ARRAY initializers.
